{% comment %}
  ZAVELYN HAIR CARE — Product-Specific & Compliance FAQ Section (v6.1 Rebuild)
  Decoupled 100% per-SKU: 5 tailored product questions + verified US shipping & guarantee FAQs.
  All accordions collapsed by default on initial page load.
{% endcomment %}
<section class="zvhc-faq-section" id="faq" style="padding: 72px 0;">
  <div class="zvhc-container">
    <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 48px;">
      <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</div>
      <h2 class="zvhc-h2">Everything You Need To Know</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); font-size: 0.95rem;">
        Clear answers about our botanical sourcing, routine application, free US shipping over $69.99, and 30-day satisfaction guarantee.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;">
      
      {% case product.handle %}
        {% when 'zvhc-batana-hair-growth-oil' %}
          <details class="zvhc-accordion-item" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
              <span>What is authentic Honduran Batana oil and how is it sourced?</span>
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
            </summary>
            <div style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6;">
              Authentic Batana oil is extracted from the nuts of the American oil palm (<em>Elaeis oleifera</em>) wild-harvested in the La Mosquitia region of Honduras. Traditional artisanal roasting gives the oil its characteristic dark amber hue, subtle roasted aroma, and rich profile of oleic and linoleic fatty acids.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="zvhc-accordion-item" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
              <span>How many drops should I apply to my scalp versus hair lengths?</span>
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
            </summary>
            <div style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6;">
              For direct scalp conditioning, dispense 4–6 drops along parted sections and massage gently for 2–3 minutes. For dry mid-lengths and split ends, warm 2–3 drops between palms and smooth over strands. A little goes a long way due to its rich lipid concentration.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="zvhc-accordion-item" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
              <span>Can I leave this oil on overnight as an intensive conditioning soak?</span>
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
            </summary>
            <div style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6;">
              Yes. Leaving the oil on overnight under a silk bonnet or wrap allows the natural botanical lipids to thoroughly soften brittle cuticles and nourish dry scalp barriers. Wash out with your regular shampoo the following morning.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="zvhc-accordion-item" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
              <span>Does this formula wash out cleanly with regular shampoo?</span>
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
            </summary>
            <div style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6;">
              Because our oil contains zero synthetic silicones, mineral oils, or waxes, it rinses out completely with one to two gentle shampoo lathers without leaving gummy residue or weighing down fine hair textures.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="zvhc-accordion-item" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
              <span>What is the shelf life and proper storage condition?</span>
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
            </summary>
            <div style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6;">
              Stored in its UV-filtering amber glass dropper bottle in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight, the formula maintains full botanical potency for up to 24 months unopened (12 months after opening).
            </div>
          </details>

        {% when 'zvhc-keratin-hair-building-fibers' %}
          <details class="zvhc-accordion-item" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
              <span>How do Keratin Building Fibers bond to existing hair?</span>
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
            </summary>
            <div style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6;">
              Our precision micro-milled keratin and organic cotton fibers carry an innate electrostatic charge. When shaken over dry hair, they adhere securely via electrostatic attraction to individual hair shafts, creating instant optical density and fullness.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="zvhc-accordion-item" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
