              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
            </summary>
            <div style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6;">
              Choose the shade that matches your hair root color. For natural black and soft black hair, choose Black. For rich chocolate and deep espresso tones, select Dark Brown. For chestnut, honey, or warm brown hair, choose Medium Brown. You can also mix two shades for custom multidimensional blending.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="zvhc-accordion-item" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
              <span>Will the fibers stay in place during wind, workout sweat, or light rain?</span>
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
            </summary>
            <div style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6;">
              Yes. The electrostatic lock holds through normal daily activity, outdoor breeze, and workout perspiration. For maximum all-day hold against gusty wind or rain, mist lightly with any standard hairspray after application.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="zvhc-accordion-item" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
              <span>Does this product stain skin, clothing, or pillowcases?</span>
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
            </summary>
            <div style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6;">
              No. The fibers are 100% colorfast mineral-pigmented keratin. If stray fibers land on clothing or skin, simply dust them away with a dry hand or tissue. They do not run, smear, or bleed color.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="zvhc-accordion-item" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px;">
            <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
              <span>How do I wash out the fibers?</span>
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
            </summary>
            <div style="margin-top: 14px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6;">
              Keratin Building Fibers wash out completely with your regular shampoo in warm water. They leave no residue on the scalp and do not clog hair follicles.
